		{
			"id": "npTpx13bKeqk0epLm",
			"text": "Independent build total: 202 points of racial traits plus 4 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nDl5Yli5tbaHTVB32",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Skeleton (SRD 5.1); Skeleton (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nHVYCD40sapPrszTP",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nGvRx650R3_-m2Phn",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 10 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nAFgynpC-OMO4Js4W",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 5 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "n85Z3F5NCMaXnEL5u",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nb3ZL-gmusGO3MpsY",
			"text": "A human frame stripped to bone, which is the SM 0 row at about 10 kg."
		},
		{
			"id": "nxchfX23EsmYlyd8e",
			"text": "Brittle: any major wound shatters structure, and the stat notes trade flesh's forgiveness for that. Impaling and piercing weapons find nothing worth finding; treat the injury tolerance literally."
		},
		{
			"id": "nXI9KP3codtm6sOJA",
			"text": "FP is stated rather than derived because nothing here has a metabolism to tire (issue #17)."
		},
